00:15:01,821 --> 00:15:04,820
We found a rattlesnake in a hill here.

265
00:15:04,821 --> 00:15:07,220
It's a western diamondback rattlesnake.

266
00:15:07,221 --> 00:15:10,620
We try to pull him out of this hole.

267
00:15:10,621 --> 00:15:12,120
They swell up sometimes,

268
00:15:12,121 --> 00:15:14,660
and you can't get them out very easy.

269
00:15:14,661 --> 00:15:16,800
We try to be safe, not hurt the animal.

270
00:15:20,700 --> 00:15:23,260
They can swing around and bite you at any time.

271
00:15:24,480 --> 00:15:27,000
Most rattlesnake venom is hemotoxic.

272
00:15:27,940 --> 00:15:30,540
That means it contains proteins and enzymes

273
00:15:30,541 --> 00:15:34,340
