274
00:15:34,520 --> 00:15:37,080
If you want to know what a snake bite feels like,

275
00:15:37,320 --> 00:15:41,020
it hits your finger with a five-pound sludge hammer.

276
00:15:41,420 --> 00:15:42,880
There's internal hemorrhage, swelling,

277
00:15:43,060 --> 00:15:44,160
and it's just very painful.

278
00:15:44,660 --> 00:15:47,200
If it's a bad enough bite, sometimes the swelling

279
00:15:47,300 --> 00:15:48,960
could be so bad that the skin, they'll

280
00:15:49,060 --> 00:15:52,140
have to split your skin because it'll start swelling so much

281
00:15:52,240 --> 00:15:54,840
it'll actually start destroying the muscle tissue.

282
00:15:54,940 --> 00:15:57,100
Let's go ahead and somebody mix the Crofab

