286
00:16:06,140 --> 00:16:10,760
like respiratory failure, involuntary muscle

287
00:16:10,761 --> 00:16:16,600
contractions, or anaphylaxis, a rare whole-body allergic

288
00:16:16,700 --> 00:16:18,900
reaction that can restrict breathing

289
00:16:19,000 --> 00:16:23,700
and cause abdominal cramps, vomiting, and extreme swelling.

290
00:16:23,800 --> 00:16:26,400
I can't believe that little guy did that.

291
00:16:29,520 --> 00:16:31,220
Nobody dies from a rattlesnake bite,

292
00:16:31,320 --> 00:16:34,420
but a lot of people go into shock from a rattlesnake bite

293
00:16:34,520 --> 00:16:37,320
and die from it.

294
00:16:37,420 --> 00:16:39,320
The Western's long, deadly fangs

