298
00:16:48,860 --> 00:16:51,060
Glands in the back of the head pump venom

299
00:16:51,160 --> 00:16:52,660
through the hollow fangs into the prey.

300
00:16:55,360 --> 00:16:58,380
If it's your lucky day, you could be the recipient

301
00:16:58,480 --> 00:17:00,380
of a dry bite.

