00:18:07,500 --> 00:18:10,200
We call that a coontail.

321
00:18:10,300 --> 00:18:14,340
There's also lots to learn at the rattlesnake roundup.

322
00:18:14,440 --> 00:18:20,120
If confronted, your best bet is to move very slowly.

323
00:18:20,220 --> 00:18:23,180
Rattlesnakes typically strike a moving target,

324
00:18:23,280 --> 00:18:24,620
in this case, a balloon.

325
00:18:28,120 --> 00:18:28,920
Just like that.

326
00:18:28,921 --> 00:18:29,820
Yeah.

327
00:18:33,420 --> 00:18:35,820
Although the venom of these lightning fast snakes

328
00:18:35,821 --> 00:18:40,160
