343
00:19:30,180 --> 00:19:32,880
The dangerous work demands so much focus

344
00:19:32,980 --> 00:19:36,360
that the center's rules limit the milkings to a maximum of 20

345
00:19:36,460 --> 00:19:37,820
snakes per day.

346
00:19:37,920 --> 00:19:39,560
OK, this is a Mojave.

347
00:19:39,660 --> 00:19:41,660
It's one of the most toxic venoms

348
00:19:41,760 --> 00:19:44,500
that we have in the United States.

349
00:19:44,600 --> 00:19:47,060
This uncooperative inmate is the Western Diamondback's

350
00:19:47,160 --> 00:19:50,200
big cousin, the Eastern Diamondback.

351
00:19:54,380 --> 00:19:55,400
OK, don't worry.

352
00:19:55,500 --> 00:19:56,200
Don't worry.

353
00:19:56,201 --> 00:19:58,840
Get him from the middle ground.

354
00:19:58,940 --> 00:20:00,680
The eastern diamondback is the largest

355
00:20:00,780 --> 00:20:03,780
of all rattlesnakes, and because of its more frequent

356
00:20:03,880 --> 00:20:06,580
attacks on humans, is arguably as dangerous

357
00:20:06,680 --> 00:20:09,180
as the western diamondback.

358
00:20:09,280 --> 00:20:10,980
OK, I'm going to pin his head down.

359
00:20:15,600 --> 00:20:19,800
This is a western diamondback, or a eastern diamondback.

360
00:20:19,900 --> 00:20:23,900
And I'm going to let it bite into this diaphragm.

361
00:20:23,901 --> 00:20:27,840
This one really gets a lot of them.

362
00:20:27,940 --> 00:20:30,700
When the snake's fangs puncture a paraffin barrier,

363
00:20:30,800 --> 00:20:32,740
it immediately pumps venom into the cup.

364
00:20:37,040 --> 00:20:40,220
Each snake has a barcode-like device called a PIT tag

365
00:20:40,320 --> 00:20:44,080
